&lt;p style="margin-left: 18px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -12px"&gt;負債&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 18px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;社債及び借入金（レベル２）&lt;/p&gt;
